{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["מלאתך ודמעך לא תאחר — this is what is written: ״ראשית דגנך תירשך ויצהרך״. The מלאה — the terumah of grain, as written: ״המלאה הזרע״." "ודמעך — this is the תירוש and שמן זית יצהר, for they are clear and like a tear (דמעה) and refined. And so Menachem explained." "לא תאחר — but rather first and beginning of all tithes. בכור בניך כן תעשה לשורך וגו' — all these are matters of ראשית."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:42.359437966Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}